      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Pharmacokinetic properties of imidazobenzimidazole derivative compound RU-1205 were investigated after subcutaneous administration to rabbits as a substance and a dosage form (lyophilisates for injection) at a dose of 25 mg/kg. The lyophilisate was characterized by high values of the relative bioavailability. In tests, the \"hot plate\" and \"vinegar cramps\" the dosage form and the substance exhibited the same analgesic effect."},
